{"data":[{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-08T14:59:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108210594696540528"],"id":"2108210594696540528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":3062,"like_count":31,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":6},"text":"没有主体性时人最舒服的地方是可以转移责任。听父母的、听伴侣的、听领导的、听社会标准的、听\"大家都这样\"的。\n\n这样即使不快乐，也可以把责任推出去。\n\n但主体性意味着:这是我选的、这是我不要的、这是我要承担的、这是我不能再装不知道的。\n\n你拿回了自己，也拿回了责任。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108210594696540528"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-08T04:19:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108049628704997830"],"id":"2108049628704997830","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":6987,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2105255354674315527","type":"quoted"}],"text":"节前有人问我东山精密，确实不好回答哇，今天跌停咯！ https://t.co/C3MBFTiKUV","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108049628704997830"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:57:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108029064502260004"],"id":"2108029064502260004","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":7861,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我的量化显示，市场又冰点了哦，除了微盘股！ https://t.co/0RXcYMyTkq","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108029064502260004"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:47:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108026353622900810"],"id":"2108026353622900810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3162,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2106723996612104306","type":"quoted"}],"text":"10000粉这么慢吗，我们可都是马前炮，不值得大家给个关注？ https://t.co/wnZPTgv3qa","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/2108026353622900810"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","created_at":"2026-10-08T02:35:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108023543913230808"],"id":"2108023543913230808","public_metrics":{"bookmark